00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:54.560
it really is the same logic. We're figuring out&nbsp;
where a linear approximation of the function&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:54.560 --> 00:11:00.000
around your guess would equal zero, and then&nbsp;
